.env
.streamlit/secrets.toml
*.key

# NOTE what is deliberately NOT ignored, because the app needs it at runtime:
#   *.joblib                                  the 16 property models
#   models_bagged/bagged_*.joblib             uncertainty companions
#   models_bagged/companion_calibration.json
#   validation/uncertainty_calibration.json   per-molecule error bars
#   fpscores.pkl.gz                           SA-score data
# validation/*.md, tests/ and md/ are kept too: they are the evidence base and are small.
